        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tommy Swerdlow, Jon Turteltaub, Leon, Doug E. Doug, Rawle D. Lewis, Malik Yoba, John Candy, George B. Fitch\n- Films: Howard the Duck, Spaceballs, Cool Runnings, Little Giants, Snow Dogs, A Thousand Junkies\n\nFacts:\n- Tommy Swerdlow appeared in the films \"Howard the Duck\" (1986) and \"Spaceballs\" (1987).\n- Cool Runnings is a 1993 American comedy sports film directed by Jon Turteltaub and starring Leon, Doug E. Doug, Rawle D. Lewis, Malik Yoba, and John Candy.\n- Tommy Swerdlow co-wrote the screenplay for Cool Runnings (1993).\n- George B. Fitch's success inspired the Disney film Cool Runnings.\n- Tommy Swerdlow co-wrote the screenplays for Little Giants (1994) and Snow Dogs (2002).\n- A Thousand Junkies is a 2017 American comedy-drama film directed by and starring Tommy Swerdlow.",
